---
import PublicPage from "./PublicPage.astro";
---

<PublicPage
  overlayHeader
  title="关于宠伴 | PetCare 宠伴"
  description="了解 PetCare 如何从宠物日常开始，把照护前的约定与过程记录连接起来。"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="interior-page interior-page--about about-page">
    <section
      class="interior-page__hero interior-page__hero--reverse about-page__hero"
      aria-labelledby="about-title"
    >
      <div class="interior-page__hero-scene">
        <img src="/brand/home/together.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" fetchpriority="high" />
      </div>
      <div class="interior-page__hero-wash" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="interior-page__hero-inner content-container">
        <div class="interior-page__hero-copy">
          <p class="interior-page__eyebrow">PETCARE · 关于宠伴</p>
          <h1 id="about-title"><span>陪伴</span>每一次托付。</h1>
          <p class="interior-page__hero-description">
            宠物成为家人后，短暂离开也多一份牵挂。PetCare
            希望把照护前的约定、过程中的进展和结束后的记录，连成一段清楚可见的陪伴。
          </p>
          <a class="interior-page__button" href="/product">探索产品体验</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img
        class="interior-page__hero-wave"
        src="/brand/interior/about-wave.svg"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </section>

    <section
      class="interior-page__section content-container about-page__daily"
      aria-labelledby="about-daily-title"
    >
      <div class="about-page__daily-copy">
        <h2 id="about-daily-title">先读懂它的日常。</h2>
        <p>饮食、习惯与照护备注，值得在每次安排前被认真了解。让照护从具体的生活细节开始。</p>
        <p class="interior-page__stage-line">理解 · 托付 · 陪伴</p>
        <figure class="interior-page__photo about-page__cat-photo">
          <img src="/brand/home/home.png" alt="橘猫和主人一起度过安静的居家时光" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
      </div>
      <article
        class="interior-page__profile-card about-page__profile-card"
        aria-label="宠物档案内容示例"
      >
        <header>
          <div>
            <p class="interior-page__card-label">宠物档案</p>
            <h3>团子的日常</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="interior-page__profile-hint">生活习惯</span>
        </header>
        <div class="interior-page__profile-content">
          <img src="/brand/home/care-record.png" alt="金毛犬在家中与照护者相处" loading="lazy" />
          <dl>
            <div><dt>饮食习惯</dt><dd>吃饭慢一些，使用熟悉的食盆。</dd></div>
            <div><dt>喜欢的日常</dt><dd>在窗边休息，也喜欢有人陪玩。</dd></div>
            <div><dt>照护备注</dt><dd>先安静靠近，再逐渐互动。</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <p class="interior-page__sample-note">档案内容为示例，不代表真实用户资料。</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section
      class="interior-page__section content-container about-page__relationship"
      aria-labelledby="about-relationship-title"
    >
      <figure class="interior-page__photo about-page__walk-photo">
        <img src="/brand/home/walk.png" alt="主人与金毛在熟悉的户外小路上散步" loading="lazy" />
      </figure>
      <div class="about-page__relationship-copy">
        <h2 id="about-relationship-title">把托付说清楚，<br />也把过程留下来。</h2>
        <article>
          <h3>了解习惯</h3>
          <p>让宠物的生活细节成为安排的起点。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>确认安排</h3>
          <p>让双方的时间、内容和责任清楚对齐。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>记录陪伴</h3>
          <p>让过程记录与生活阅读，连接托付前后。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="interior-page__closing content-container about-page__closing">
      <div>
        <h2>陪伴，从了解开始。</h2>
        <a class="interior-page__button" href="/product">探索产品体验</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</PublicPage>
